{
  "id": "ember_iman_talk",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "A figure crossing the drifts with a pole, testing ahead of every step, and no apparent interest in stopping."
        },
        {
          "text": "“Follow my line exactly or do not follow it. The ash does not hold everywhere.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "ember_iman_warm",
          "text": "Which drifts are warm?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "ember_roofs_warm"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                11,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_vent_readers",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "ember_iman_warm_told",
            "onFailure": "ember_iman_warm_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ember_iman_warmground",
          "text": "You cross warm ground for a living. Is the village's ground the same as Slagfoot's?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "ember_warm_never"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "insight",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                12,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_vent_readers",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "ember_iman_warmground_told",
            "onFailure": "ember_iman_warmground_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ember_iman_one",
          "text": "How long did the fall take?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "ember_roofs_one"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                13,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_vent_readers",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "ember_iman_one_told",
            "onFailure": "ember_iman_one_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "greet_leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ember_iman_warm_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“The ones over the village.” She does not break stride. “A foot down and warm to the hand, and the rest of the Ashfall is stone cold. Nine years I have crossed this. It is the same ground every time.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "ember_roofs_warm"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "ember_iman_warm_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ember_iman_warm_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_vent_readers",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "ember_iman_warm_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ember_iman_warmground_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“No.” She is definite. “Slagfoot is warm all the way down and always has been — you can stand on it barefoot in midwinter and I have. Mine is warm a foot down and cold under that.” She moves on. “Different things making it.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "ember_warm_never"
          }
        }
      ],
